      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "By attaching the physbone, we have confirmed that an avatar has been created to represent the ragdoll.\nInstead, it seems that the AV3 side also needs to create a corresponding state for the animator. (EMOTE, state approximating AFK)\nUsing the Physbone mechanism, it may be possible to create a ragdoll function that is lightweight and more consistent with the avatar's system.\nThis item has been TRACKED INTERNALLY for quite some time now and still has not been addressed.\nIn addition, the CombatSystem is still broken, not available.\nHopefully there will be some good news...\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/evolved-ragdolls-with-sdk3-in-mind-alternative-to-combat-systemsdk3",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
